OL,3,GNEWSAFrom jumpers to slug pellets - how
OL,4,ABritish wool is back in demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rising cost may not be welcomed by
OL,7,Fshoppers seeking woolly socks and
OL,8,Fjumpers this winter, but it does mean
OL,9,Ffarmers are more likely to cover the
OL,10,Fcost of shearing.
